{"id":"wb-7-314","name":"京城古城址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"京城古城址","text":"京城古城址位于河南省郑州市荥阳市豫龙镇京襄城村，为春秋时期的城市遗址。城址平面呈长方形，南北长约1810米，东西宽约1499米。地面现存城墙八段，共长1000余米，高3-7米，基宽25米。\n1986年11月21日，河南省人民政府将京城古城址列为第二批河南省文物保护单位。2013年3月，中国国务院列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位（古遗址）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%AC%E5%9F%8E%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93751997,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93751997","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/77981009c27541d0075c2153.jpg","title":"20210509_The_Site_of_the_Ancient_City_of_Jing_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20210509_The_Site_of_the_Ancient_City_of_Jing_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/20210509_The_Site_of_the_Ancient_City_of_Jing_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​The Site of the Ancient City of Jing","width":320,"height":213}}